  "code": "compute() -> Tasks.TASK[int] is\n    let a = await double_async(10)   // a = 20\n    let b = await double_async(a)    // b = 40\n    let c = await add_async(a, b)    // c = 60\n\n    return c\nsi\n\nwrite_line(\"{compute().result}\")",
